Duel Dimension - outfit skins
=============================

Every outfit in this folder is somebody else's work. They are used here with
credit; the same credit is shown in game on the row that selects the outfit, so
it travels with the thing it is for rather than living only in this file.

If you add an outfit, add its line here and its credit line in
Outfits.java at the same time.


kaiba.png   Seto Kaiba
            XyaMorph (PlanetMinecraft)
            https://www.planetminecraft.com/skin/seto-kaiba-yu-gi-oh/

yusei.png   Yusei Fudo
            Daiosity (PlanetMinecraft)
            https://www.planetminecraft.com/skin/yusei-fudo-yu-gi-oh-skin-series-with-turtleover/


Both were drawn in the legacy 64x32 skin format where applicable and converted
to the 64x64 layout by tools/convert_skin.py, which mirrors the right arm and
leg into their own regions the way Minecraft's own converter does. The artwork
itself is unchanged.
